{"about_the_game":"Song of a Spirit is a Game Jam submission made in 14 days. It is a crafting game that explores an unconstrained approach to writing tunes, rhythms and melodies. <br><br>Gameplay:<br>Layout your note orbs in a classic linear or randomly placed fashion. Use the stone plated as timing indicators, place a pair of trigger totems in any orientation and launch an energy wave to trigger your note orbs from any direction. <br><br>Mechanics<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tone Wand <br></li><li> 10 Sounds (4 Percussive &amp; 6 Tonal) to experiment with<br></li><li> Tone wand to Set, Retrieve, Trigger the Note orbs<br></li><li> Trigger Totems for triggering Note Orbs from any direction<br></li><li> Routing and trigger poles for connecting, routing and looping the music patterns</li></ul><br>Use sound and resources of the surrounding environment to craft various whimsical instruments.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1111130?t=1697847766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1111130?t=1697847766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1697847766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1697847766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Song of a Spirit is a Game Jam submission made in 14 days. It is a crafting game that explores an unconstrained approach to writing tunes, rhythms and melodies. <br><br>Gameplay:<br>Layout your note orbs in a classic linear or randomly placed fashion. Use the stone plated as timing indicators, place a pair of trigger totems in any orientation and launch an energy wave to trigger your note orbs from any direction. <br><br>Mechanics<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tone Wand <br></li><li> 10 Sounds (4 Percussive &amp; 6 Tonal) to experiment with<br></li><li> Tone wand to Set, Retrieve, Trigger the Note orbs<br></li><li> Trigger Totems for triggering Note Orbs from any direction<br></li><li> Routing and trigger poles for connecting, routing and looping the music patterns</li></ul><br>Use sound and resources of the surrounding environment to craft various whimsical instruments.","developers":["Eisenstadt Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111130/header.jpg?t=1697847766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/619272/6f973bc214b2f32109915cac0c0e1473fedbd192/1751189963/dash_av1.mpd?t=1697482502","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/619272/6f973bc214b2f32109915cac0c0e1473fedbd192/1751189963/dash_h264.mpd?t=1697482502","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/619272/6f973bc214b2f32109915cac0c0e1473fedbd192/1751189963/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1697482502","id":256976281,"name":"Game Play trailer #1 - 2023 Godot re-build","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256976281/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1697482502"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/620910/025fbc5fe146063a69ea69fbfbbb16fdeaf5d8a8/1751189964/dash_av1.mpd?t=1697846345","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/620910/025fbc5fe146063a69ea69fbfbbb16fdeaf5d8a8/1751189964/dash_h264.mpd?t=1697846345","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1111130/620910/025fbc5fe146063a69ea69fbfbbb16fdeaf5d8a8/1751189964/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1697846345","id":256977171,"name":"Game Play trailer #3 - 2023 Godot re-build","thumbnail":"https://